<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Victor Odukoya"
  description="Privacy Policy for Victor Odukoya's apps and services."
  lastUpdated="November 20, 2026"
>
  <p>For the data used by Pair Journey, including sign-in, learning decks, purchases, ads and deletion, see the <a href="/privacy/pair-journey/">Pair Journey Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  <p class="lead">
    Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how Victor Odukoya
    ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and protects your information when you use our
    apps and services.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

  <h3>1.1 Information You Provide</h3>
  <p>When you use our apps, you may provide us with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Account Information:</strong> Account identifiers and, where provided, email address and name when signing in with Apple, Google or an email code</li>
    <li><strong>User Content:</strong> Catalogs, word pairs, and other content you create</li>
    <li><strong>Support Requests:</strong> Information you provide when contacting support</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>1.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
  <p>We may automatically collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Feature data:</strong> Data needed to provide a feature you use, such as account sign-in, cloud backup, AI generation, purchases, or advertising</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> Device, diagnostic, and crash information only where the app or an enabled provider collects it; the exact release inventory is still being verified</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <p>We use your information to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Provide and improve our apps and services</li>
    <li>Process in-app purchases and subscriptions</li>
    <li>Sync your data across devices (if you opt in)</li>
    <li>Respond to your support requests</li>
    <li>Send important updates about the app (not marketing)</li>
    <li>Analyze usage patterns to improve user experience</li>
  </ul>

