  <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
  <p>
    Learning data is stored locally by default. If you enable cloud backup, a copy is stored in private account storage on Supabase. This backup is not end-to-end encrypted. See the app-specific policy for retention and deletion details.
  </p>
  <p>For privacy questions about a particular service, contact support.</p>

  <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of your data</li>
    <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Update or correct your information</li>
    <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your account and data</li>
    <li><strong>Export:</strong> Export your data in a portable format</li>
    <li><strong>Privacy choices:</strong> Exercise applicable rights and manage consent choices provided in the app or by a service</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at the email below.</p>

  <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    Pair Journey is intended for adults aged 18 and over. The app does not ask for an age self-declaration. Store age controls depend on the platform and region.
  </p>

  <h2>7. International Users</h2>

  <h3>European Union (GDPR)</h3>
  <p>If you are in the EU, you have additional rights under the General Data Protection Regulation:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Right to data portability</li>
    <li>Right to restrict processing</li>
    <li>Right to object to processing</li>
    <li>Right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Legal basis for processing: Legitimate interests, consent, and contract performance.</p>

  <h3>California (CCPA)</h3>
  <p>If you are a California resident, you have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Know what personal information we collect</li>
    <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
    <li>Ask about the handling of personal information and exercise rights available under applicable law</li>
    <li>Non-discrimination for exercising your rights</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>8. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>Retention depends on the service and the purpose. For Pair Journey, the app-specific policy explains local storage, cloud snapshots, email delivery logs, AI processing and account deletion. Contact support about data held for a particular request.</p>

  <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant
    changes through the app or via email. The "Last updated" date at the top indicates the
    most recent revision.
  </p>

  <h2>10. App-Specific Policies</h2>
  <p>For app-specific privacy information, see:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/privacy/pair-journey">Pair Journey Privacy Policy</a></li>
  </ul>

